d 'MMD_2S': module to perform Two-sample Maximum Mean Discrepancy (MMD) test
d
d   mmd_2s tests the null hypothesis that two independent samples
d were drawn from the same    distribution, using a Maximum Mean
d Discrepancy (MMD) statistic with an RBF (Gaussian)	kernel and
d a bootstrap p-value. 
d
d KW: mean discrepancy
d KW: two-sample test
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260729
d
d Author: Andres Talavera Cuya,   Direccion Nacional de Censos y Encuestas -- INEI Peru
d Support: email talaveracuya@@gmail.com
d
f mmd_2s.ado
f mmd_2s.sthlp
f mmd_2s_es.sthlp
